  "description": "SUV PRO PRO-ZEB Fork with SRAM GX Eagle AXS groupset\n\nFRAMESET\n\nFrame\nTORAY T800&T700 carbon fiber, 150mm travel, internal cable routing, post mount disc brake, 148x12 thru axle\n\nFork\nDengFu suspension fork 160mm travel, 1 1/8\"-1 1/2\"(OD62mm,ID56mm).\n\nMOTOR\n\nMotor\nBAFANG M560 750W 48V MAX torque: 130 N.m/45km/h speed limit\n\nBattery\nLithium-ion 48V 21Ah 1008Wh 4A fast charging\n\nDRIVETRAIN\n\nRear Derailleur\nSRAM 12 RD X5 9S LONG CAGE BLK.\n\nCassette\nSRAM CS PG 920 11-34 9 Speed\n\nShifters\nSRAM X5 TRIGGER REAR 9-SPD BLK 2200MM CABLE\n\nBrakes\nShimano MT200 hydraulic 2 Piston Brakes.\n\nWHEELSET\n\nWheels\n36mm-27.5er Aluminum Alloy, ECC+DT spokes, 32/32 holes.\n\nHandlebar\nAluminum Swallow handle 740mm.\n\nSaddle\nTTZ008 Comfortable Black.\n\nFRAMESET\n\nFrame\nTORAY T800&T700 carbon fiber, 170mm travel, internal cable routing, post mount disc brake, 148x12 thru axle\n\nFork\nSRAM YARI suspension fork, 160mm travel, Black, 1 1/8\"-1 1/2\"(OD62mm,ID56mm)./SRAM ZEB suspension fork, 180mm travel\n\nSeat post\nUDING suspension seat post, 150mm travel.\n\nMOTOR\n\nMotor\nBAFANG M560 750W 48V MAX torque: 130 N.m/45km/h speed limit\n\nBattery\nLithium-ion 48V 21Ah 1008Wh 4A fast charging\n\nDRIVETRAIN\n\nRear Derailleur\nSRAM SX 12S.\n\nCassette\nSRAM SX 12S 12 Speed.\n\nShifters\nSRAM SX 12S.\n\nBrakes\nSRAM G2.\n\nChain\nSRAM SX 12S.\n\nWHEELSET\n\nWheels\n36mm-29er Aluminum Alloy, ECC+DT spokes, 32/32 holes. (if you need 27.5er, pls specify in the order)\n\nTyre\nMAXXIS 29erx2.6.\n\nCOMPONENTS\n\nRear Shock\nSRAM ROCKSHOX RS DLX SEL R 230x60\n\nHandlebar\nAluminum handle 800mm.\n\nSaddle\nComfortable, black FIZIK.\n\nFRAMESET\n\nFrame\nTORAY T800&T700 carbon fiber, 170mm travel, internal cable routing, post mount disc brake, 148x12 thru axle\n\nSeat post\nEXA, suspension seat post, 31.6mm diameter, 150mm drop\n\nMOTOR\n\nMotor\nBAFANG M560 750W 48V MAX torque: 130 N.m/45km/h speed limit\n\nBattery\nLithium-ion 48V 21Ah 1008Wh 4A fast charging\n\nWHEELSET\n\nWheels\nCarbon 29er mtb wheels - 29er carbon rims 35mm width with Novatec D791/D792 disc hub (Shimano free body, 28/28h) and DT Champion spokes, all black for hub, spokes (if you need front and rear 27.5er or mullet combination, pls specify in the order)\n\nTyre\nMAXXIS 29erx2.6.\n\nHandlebar\nAluminum Swallow handle 800mm.\n\nSaddle\nComfortable, black FIZIK.",
